        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Colonial Emergency Exit 5210 Knob With 5048 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Baldwin made solid brass knob is the perfect addition to any period-style home. The ever popular Colonial Knobset is a reflection of times gone by. The 5210 knob with the 5048 rosette will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. An emergency exit knob, the lock is activated by a key from the exterior or by a push-button located in the middle of the interior knob. Turning the interior knob will retract the latchbolt for immediate egress but will not unlock the outside knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Emergency Exit:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is activated by a key from the exterior or by a push-button located in the middle of the interior knob. Turning the interior knob retracts the latchbolt for immediate egress. The door will remain locked from the exterior. Comes with an adjustable backset latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5210 Colonial Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolt springs.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" 6 pin lock cylinder, pinned to 5</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Includes standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Colonial Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter:  2.241\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter:  2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection:  2.474\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt Throw:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" – 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Function: Single Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Emergency Exit Keyed Colonial Knob",
                "description": "Baldwin Colonial Emergency Exit 5210 Knob With 5048 Rosette - This Baldwin made solid brass knob is the perfect addition to any period-style home. The ever popular Colonial Knobset is a reflection of times gone by. The 5210 knob with the 5048 rosette will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.  An emergency exit knob, the lock is activated by a key from the exterior or by a push-button located in the middle of the interior knob. Turning the interior knob will retract the latchbolt for immediate egress but will not unlock the outside knob.",
